{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京都出身　19歳"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5次元が理解できてない大野愛実です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1次元は線"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2次元は線+線で面"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3次元は面+高さで空間"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "4次元は空間＋時間で時空"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じゃあ5次元は…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "時空＋n＝"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "無数の世界が重なり合う、可能性の次元！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうだといいなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうなれるといいなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで今日の写真ぜんぶ。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3DSで撮ったよ💻⚡️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10人が出会えた意味を考えてみた"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "僕たちはなぜ巡り合ったのだろう？"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobAVnY2r.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あの日、書類を送った日から2年が経とうとしています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな生まれた場所も、年齢も、性格も違うけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂46になりたい、その一つが重なった景色が、いまなのかな。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobcE5LF7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このリハ期間、五期生にはたくさんの愛を伝えてきたつもりです、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人間の感情はあやふやだけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この瞬間抱いた五期生への愛しさは間違いなく本物だったから、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから、ちゃんと言葉にしたかった！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobOSEXiT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が普段、あまりにも強がりだったから、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "急に思いもよらないこと言い出す私に自分でもびっくりしました笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「どうしたの？」「何かあったの？」と五期生は聞きたがったよね。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobu7fKZX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "偶然か必然かわからぬままだけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今 私が何よりも守りたいものたちだよ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobhytY9X.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな私たちの五期生LIVEがまもなく明日！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "始まります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがたいことに、たくさんの方々にお越しいただくとお聞きしました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "配信視聴チケットは発売中です🎫"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.hinatazaka46.com/s/official/page/5th_generation_live"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobQdJuij.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たちが出会った意味が、どんな未来に繋がって行くのか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今 僕が何よりも守りたい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛は君たちがくれたものだ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは明日！！"}], "source": "official"}